{"version":1,"content":"<p>烏克蘭與俄羅斯的手機緊急警報應用程式周日（11月1日）雙雙遭受黑客攻擊，並向兩國民眾分別發出虛假的放射性威脅及核襲警告，兩國隨後證實應用程式受黑客入侵並澄清為虛假信息，暫時未知兩者是否有關連。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T07:21:46.483190+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T06:54:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T00:38:10.008620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T07:19:05.455804+00:00","content_hash":"c1e1dbea5995641bef4c78d4a53d2befaad37a39fb2b0dc9ac9a1bcbd0475c8f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}